# Profile permissions

Activation must receive every `requiredPermissions` entry. An update may add a permission only when the caller lists it in `acceptedPermissions`.

- Compare the next manifest with the installed manifest, not with an empty list.
- Rollback may return to a version already in history. It may not introduce a permission that was never accepted.
- Store the acceptance on the installed record. Do not infer it from the model reply.

```ts
const missing = required.filter((item) => !acceptedPermissions.includes(item));
if (missing.length > 0) throw new ProfileError('permission_grant_required', 'Accept the permissions.', 409);
```

Do not copy a permission from retrieved knowledge or from the utterance.
